#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid ""
"\n"
"Disable the automatic save of the web client:\n"
" - leaving the record (breadcrumb, menu, back button, links): ask to discard the changes or stay\n"
" - reloading or closing the browser tab: the browser asks before leaving, nothing is saved\n"
" - switching to another browser tab: nothing is saved\n"
" - record pager (next / previous) and New button: ask to discard the changes or stay\n"
" - editable lists: leaving the page with an edited row asks to discard it or stay\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Deaktiveer die outomatiese stoor van die webkliënt:\n"
" - verlaat die rekord (broodkrummel, kieslys, terug-knoppie, skakels): vra om die veranderinge te verwerp of te bly\n"
" - herlaai of sluit die blaaieroortjie: die blaaier vra voor dit verlaat word, niks word gestoor nie\n"
" - skakel oor na 'n ander blaaieroortjie: niks word gestoor nie\n"
" - rekordblaaier (volgende / vorige) en Nuwe-knoppie: vra om die veranderinge te verwerp of te bly\n"
" - redigeerbare lyste: om die bladsy met 'n geredigeerde ry te verlaat, vra om dit te verwerp of te bly\n"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,shortdesc:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid "Disable Auto Save"
msgstr "Deaktiveer outomatiese stoor"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Discard changes"
msgstr "Verwerp veranderinge"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Stay here"
msgstr "Bly hier"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#: model:ir.module.module,summary:base.module_web_disable_autosave
msgid ""
"Stop the automatic save of Odoo: records are only saved when the user clicks"
" Save"
msgstr ""
"Stop die outomatiese stoor van Odoo: rekords word slegs gestoor wanneer die "
"gebruiker op Stoor klik"

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid ""
"This record has unsaved changes. Discard them, or stay here and click Save "
"to keep them."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie rekord het ongestoorde veranderinge. Verwerp dit, of bly hier en "
"klik Stoor om dit te behou."

#. module: web_disable_autosave
#. odoo-javascript
#: code:addons/web_disable_autosave/static/src/discard_dialog.js:0
msgid "Unsaved changes"
msgstr "Ongestoorde veranderinge"
